      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. delayed_state is protected by dle_mutex\n2. If we take mutex before the allocation, it would lead to the same situation.\nAs there is a race for dle_mutex between delayed_shutdown() and delayed_submit().\n\nThere is a possibility that dle_mutex could get destroyed in delayed_shutdown() before we attempt to acquire it in delayed_submit() which would lead to the crash.",
